{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"RFC.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:53:27.454897Z","id":"523ad4cb2a98253fa5f769024fa5e07cb6f0de81e8c52edce8a2225e839cc705","body":{"detail":"vcs_mapping.rs rfc_vcs_table_through_git_import (vcs@mapping, 26ad6b4): Commit->Step, Branch->Path, Author->meta.actors hold; the message body is dropped from meta.intent, gpgsig never reaches meta.signatures, deleted branches leave no dead ends. No other VCS.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:26ad6b4","span":{"start":{"line":923},"end":{"line":923},"content_hash":"71a0201bbf95a98a0273848f1776fe518a87ee97657e7f1d89e887e5593e0138"},"summary":"RFC: VCS-agnostic — only git implemented; git's mapping is pinned row by row","supersedes":"8d0491e6a44053ac43843c791386b77b5f8af79c0f24e2962eacca08c97ed918","tags":["claim:rfc-vcs-agnostic","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"RFC.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T20:53:27.455107Z","id":"72cb75897f5cc739d8a26fead7c7cc9c2590e5e7396cd24018b7ed433ad99a86","body":{"detail":"vcs@mapping (26ad6b4) pins that a deleted branch leaves no dead end; query.rs dead_ends works on any DAG; no session reader emits a fork.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:26ad6b4","span":{"start":{"line":937},"end":{"line":938},"content_hash":"25c7d39f1e89f9cf471c9a286764bd072deb3bc864f3c8289e94378f7b438d15"},"summary":"RFC beyond-VCS 2, abandoned paths preserved — format yes; git import leaves no dead ends for deleted branches, sessions emit none","supersedes":"d53122caad978619f75b34bdf1797f32f04e942ca7db0c51a1057b31d014aa75","tags":["claim:rfc-beyond-vcs-abandoned-paths","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"RFC.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T21:09:42.881020Z","id":"2dee8b5e28650765cc5296a408ee89233d7ff4a0f299bb2d1112cf97b87eb757","body":{"detail":"toolpath::v1::sign implements JCS, SHA-256 digests and the step/path author and path reviewer inputs; crates/toolpath/tests/signatures.rs (signed_step_and_path_verify, tampered_change_fails, moved_head_fails_both_path_signatures, missing_required_scope_fails, gpg_and_sigstore_are_not_verified, scopes_without_a_canonical_form_are_refused) and tests/jcs.rs (RFC 8785 reference vectors), feature 'verify' (810a58b). gpg and sigstore are refused, not verified; RFC.md:719's UTF-8 key ordering is recorded false by that piece (RFC 8785 orders by UTF-16).","kind":"pass","ref":"git:810a58b","span":{"start":{"line":712},"end":{"line":712},"content_hash":"dfd7d6d839139a01c93c727b2af1f8fd7f8a3c7d57ee39adf6db4782c331969a"},"summary":"RFC: signatures over JCS canonical form — backed for ssh Ed25519 (author and reviewer)","supersedes":"64f644fa36c165ab3db5b7101a93b141350ee377e4ee41f2eb5a0de5e56802dc","tags":["claim:rfc-jcs-signatures","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
