{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T21:47:48.873097Z","id":"8e38f2d286d35379ae637c0e031fc410429bf48328cd3b8f30f5bce77b7e51f6","body":{"detail":"Seen 2026-10-19 in Cursor 3.24.12 (copilot -> cursor, composer 7a80f0ee, 12 bubbles): the Agents window listed the chat but opened the empty new-chat view, and Cursor's agent answered a follow-up as a new conversation. Cause: the projector wrote composerData + bubbles only (_v:16, agentBackend cursor-agent, no hasLoaded); Cursor 3.24 sends the model the history listed in composerData.conversationState (protobuf field 1 = sha256 refs to agentKv:blob:<sha256> AI SDK ModelMessage JSON). The fix writes those, _v:18, hasLoaded:true and no agentBackend, matching a native 3.24 chat. Unverified until the live check: whether Cursor also needs the other conversationState fields, providerOptions, or the agent-transcripts JSONL.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":41},"end":{"line":41},"content_hash":"8f669529cef86023526352307b9f172b21e7d104b8bfc32227d9e112f706c83d"},"summary":"Cursor resume: a projected composer is listed but its transcript is not loaded; fix writes conversationState + agentKv:blob history, live check pending","supersedes":"8f9f59a73cb55d131aec204af10dfec98a82bf26aef2dc390176e099993fbf37","tags":["cursor","resume","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
