{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:30:27.087357Z","id":"c9a67a656e550d2caf18b973d27d38957e8dbc30ad39bba204e9b444dc910e59","body":{"detail":"extract_conversation sums each turn's counters into total_usage and adds breakdowns class by class into total_usage.breakdowns, never into input/output/cache counters (crates/toolpath-convo/src/extract.rs:233-250). Pinned by toolpath-convo test_total_usage_breakdowns_round_trip (output 900+100 -> 1000 with reasoning 475 beside it) and toolpath-goldens accounting::steps_add_counters_and_breakdowns_class_by_class.","kind":"pass","ref":"git:f308ab5","span":{"start":{"line":187},"end":{"line":188},"content_hash":"f945b171f368a5007aaf4ebfee77c994204bb6bb17707ff2f7e1914137f01385"},"summary":"README breakdowns: never added into the token counters — backed","supersedes":"7eca4b7c6427d1f60ff546cb125a9babf1f3b851325f80ca983ad7662ed2d6e8","tags":["claim:readme-breakdowns-never-added","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:34:45.041029Z","id":"eef37dcf2a763faeb4c48ef303b764ddcf784a0321122d3d4e99a102564bcbda","body":{"detail":"Cargo.toml [workspace.package] rust-version = \"1.94\", inherited by every member crate (cargo metadata: rust_version 1.94 on all 20), so cargo refuses an older toolchain; rust-toolchain.toml pins 1.94.0. cargo check --offline --workspace --all-targets --features path-cli/develop,toolpath/verify passes on rustc 1.94.1 (the rustup toolchain installed here); the nix dev shell builds and tests on 1.97.1.","kind":"pass","ref":"git:f308ab5","span":{"start":{"line":441},"end":{"line":441},"content_hash":"91ee9ffc76cee5cc585c20dbe45e8438c4ab8097a01b3610a475e5c528aad22d"},"summary":"README: Rust 1.94+ — declared and built","supersedes":"09cda50b87c12dba1bb21a3e77b370c61ce03de8f38e9c5f84d470d3d0c0d023","tags":["claim:readme-rust-185","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:51:16.518843Z","id":"a23fe2b3c93965456f0b685ff55542d29d95b0610295d8707b7b005141acdce6","body":{"detail":"scripts/test-quickstart.sh (gate_quickstart) runs the README line verbatim after path p cache sync over seven harnesses' sessions and asserts it prints an integer. The fixtures carry no dead ends (producers emit none for agent sessions), so the count there is 0; the dead_end field itself is covered by query.rs dead_ends_as_jaq_form and plan.rs.","kind":"pass","ref":"git:f308ab5","span":{"start":{"line":103},"end":{"line":103},"content_hash":"8b05018411bc0049e0d9c69381c0b3eeff1e1e61a50dfcf2ca125f26cf0666b5"},"summary":"README quick start: path query 'map(select(.dead_end)) | length' — runs on a synced cache — backed","supersedes":"061fd066be5570ab9a7dec872ef55b08098ff763af250a93a81329b03562778b","tags":["claim:readme-quickstart-dead-end","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"README.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T18:51:26.773606Z","id":"fec70a7f8c3fa1691a37a6f869f002a2cd1412533d35f5fa23f7674d3c8c1c8d","body":{"detail":"scripts/test-quickstart.sh (gate_quickstart), after path p cache sync over seven harnesses' sessions: the README line runs verbatim and returns a JSON array with only claude rows (empty on the fixtures: no turn there exceeds 50000 input tokens), and --source claude 'map(.cache_id) | unique' is non-empty and all claude-*. The flag is also unit-tested (crates/path-cli/tests/query.rs source_selects_by_prefix).","kind":"pass","ref":"git:f308ab5","span":{"start":{"line":104},"end":{"line":104},"content_hash":"0856950da7b1e3771a4f13917d51d04720b890d1a3777c854c579388aeb6e5fc"},"summary":"README quick start: path query --source claude — runs on a synced cache and scopes it to claude sessions — backed","supersedes":"5268530e3401ce57d82dac78e1db4de2f6223f44364631aba8008cfe411dbfd8","tags":["claim:readme-quickstart-source","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
