{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"RFC.md","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-21T14:35:42.210425Z","id":"db824441650db2a97b79ac4bb20596738d8ce2b9fd3d13edc91bf8f1cded6612","body":{"detail":"crates/toolpath/tests/signatures.rs (signed_step_and_path_verify, tampered_change_fails, moved_head_fails_both_path_signatures, missing_required_scope_fails, gpg_and_sigstore_are_not_verified, scopes_without_a_canonical_form_are_refused) and tests/jcs.rs (RFC 8785 reference vectors), feature 'verify' (810a58b). No producer signs documents. Dropped CI from the claim (consultant pick 17): the ci scope waits for the over proposal.","kind":"pass","span":{"start":{"line":941},"end":{"line":941},"content_hash":"a7b70bcfe9b64a32fd62a4c1b4b29eeadbabceae58782d358c2d19ed9fa9924f"},"summary":"RFC beyond-VCS 5, multi-party signatures: author and reviewer signatures verify (ssh Ed25519)","supersedes":"ad4488864d32f1f5aada4a6eb1a9c37fe96f0b0370f37ed4a9b3ae6e74228d3e","tags":["claim:rfc-beyond-vcs-signatures","claims","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260","session:claude-code:a69c02ae-2421-41a9-88c7-35c5942b4c1f"]}}
